      "typical_award_size": "HCD formula allocation to the County: $2,805,041 (2024 allocation year), $3,004,612 (2025), estimated $17,531,506 for the 2024-2028 five-year plan. Uses in 2026: PLHA loan of $500,000 to Arroyo Crossing Phase I, Indio (184 units; February 10, 2026), PLHA loans to Villa Verde Apartments, Coachella (March 3, 2026) and Palm Villas at State Phase I, Hemet (October 6, 2026), about $1.8 million for Shady Lane Mobile Home Park in Thermal, and a PLHA down payment program (up to $100,000 or 20% of price, combinable with HOME to $200,000, households to 120% AMI).",
